<title>GERMANY: SKW Trostberg 9-mo sales up 4 pct.</title>
<headline>SKW Trostberg 9-mo sales up 4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German speciality chemicals group SKW Trostberg AG said on Friday sales climbed four percent to 2.97 billion marks ($2 billion) in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>SKW added that its operating profit during the period was about the same as in the year-ago period with most of the profit coming from construction chemicals.</p>
<p>After its acquisition of Master Builders Technology from Swiss group Sandoz AG, SKW is to be the world's leader in construction chemicals.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 6 9756525 ($ = 1.512 German Marks)</p>
</text>
